# GM-18 target integration cases. NOT RUN: GM-17 auth/RLS/rate limit pending.
# These public RPCs are not created or granted by the independent kernel patch.
# Supply a local/LAN endpoint reachable from the test device; no real token in repo.
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:54321
@publicKey = REPLACE_WITH_LOCAL_PUBLIC_KEY
@userToken = REPLACE_WITH_TEST_USER_ACCESS_TOKEN
@anchorId = REPLACE_WITH_PUBLISHED_PUBLIC_ANCHOR_UUID
@roomId = REPLACE_WITH_TEST_ROOM_UUID
@resultId = REPLACE_WITH_ITS_RESULT_UUID

### Discovery: authenticated caller, only current published public coverage/anchors.
# After GM-17 integration: expect 200 DTO anchors/coverageAreas/serverTime.
POST {{baseUrl}}/rest/v1/rpc/get_discovery_context
apikey: {{publicKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"area_id":null,"anchor_id":null}

### Preview: >=0 and <=8 unique choices, valid target-time/radius/version.
# Adjust desired_at using server time. Never copy device clock as authority.
# Fixture/draft data must not enter production pool; no expansion on empty output.
POST {{baseUrl}}/rest/v1/rpc/preview_food_pool
apikey: {{publicKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"anchor_id":"{{anchorId}}","radius_m":1000,"desired_at":"REPLACE_WITH_CONFIRMED_FUTURE_ISO_UTC","service_mode":"dine_in","meal_slot":"lunch","time_hint":null,"cuisine_ids":null,"category_ids":null,"budget":null}

### Result offerings: member-only, same persisted winner/variant, never reroll.
# Expect no substitute winner when its offerings become unavailable.
POST {{baseUrl}}/rest/v1/rpc/get_result_offerings
apikey: {{publicKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"room_id":"{{roomId}}","result_id":"{{resultId}}"}

### Missing auth: must reject; test outsider/left member using separate test token.
POST {{baseUrl}}/rest/v1/rpc/get_result_offerings
apikey: {{publicKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"room_id":"{{roomId}}","result_id":"{{resultId}}"}
